        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "After the warranty period, we offer service contracts that enable our customers to continue service and maintenance coverage.",
        "start_character": 11832,
        "end_character": 11957
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we divested of the 3DXpert business in 2025, we continue to sell and support 3DXpert to existing and future customers for their use with our metal printing systems through our relationship with Hubb Ventures.",
        "start_character": 10545,
        "end_character": 10762
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our strategy to help customers adopt additive manufacturing, we offer advanced manufacturing services through facilities in the Americas and EMEA regions.",
        "start_character": 12491,
        "end_character": 12656
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Consequently, we have ongoing R&D programs to develop new products and to enhance our portfolio of products and services, as well as to improve and expand the capabilities of our solutions.",
        "start_character": 18722,
        "end_character": 18911
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For metal additive manufacturing systems, we offer leading solutions for product design, simulation, mold and die design, 3D scan-to-print, reverse engineering, production machining, metrology, inspection, and manufacturing workflows.",
        "start_character": 10310,
        "end_character": 10544
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our internally developed technology platforms, we have acquired products and technologies developed by others by acquiring business entities that hold ownership rights to such products and technologies.",
        "start_character": 19639,
        "end_character": 19856
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In other instances, we have licensed or purchased the intellectual property rights of technologies developed by third parties through agreements that may obligate us to pay a license fee or royalty, typically based upon a dollar amount per unit or a percentage of the revenue generated by such products.",
        "start_character": 19857,
        "end_character": 20160
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our Company is advancing additive manufacturing through ongoing product innovation, and as such we recognize the importance of the retention, growth, and development of our employees – employees are necessary to achieving our long-term success.",
        "start_character": 28175,
        "end_character": 28419
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Product design and application development are based in the United States (\"U.S.\") and Europe, where we also maintain major manufacturing centers.",
        "start_character": 13465,
        "end_character": 13611
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These efforts are expected to result in new products that we will market directly or in conjunction with development or channel partners.",
        "start_character": 19501,
        "end_character": 19638
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015997",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015997-84d5360abc4b353c",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015997",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide services to assist our customers and partners in developing new applications for our technologies to facilitate the use of our technology for specific applications, to train customers on the use of our printers and to maintain our printers at customer sites.",
